  "body": "After more than 24 years of ownership, 112 Weatherly Road is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a generous 639m² freehold(more/less), this property offers a rare combination of land, location and future potential. Whether you're looking to renovate and enjoy it as a comfortable family home, add value over time, or investigate the subdivision potential, the opportunity is here.\r\n\r\nThe existing single-level home offers a practical layout with 3 bedrooms, 1 bathroom and a single garage, providing a solid foundation for those looking to modernise, improve and add value.\r\n\r\nKey highlights:\r\n* 639m² freehold(more/less) with all services onsite\r\n* Subdivision/development potential, subject to Council approval\r\n* Existing single level 3 bedroom home\r\n* Single garage\r\n* Great opportunity to modernise it  and add value\r\n* Zoned for Glamorgan Primary School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n* Convenient Central Torbay location\r\n* The property is selling on as is where is basis\r\n\r\nLand opportunities like this are becoming increasingly difficult to find. Whether you're a family looking for a home with upside, a renovator, or a buyer wanting to explore future development potential, this is one worth putting on your radar.\r\n\r\n112 Weatherly Road, Torbay - 639m² of opportunity. Don't miss it.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies from Day 1.",
